# Host & member model (one bounded context — not whole-product alignment)

**Whole system:** `docs/SYSTEM_COHERENCE.md` · `npm run verify:system`  
**This rule scope:** host capabilities + Pro/buddy publish gates only.

**Canonical docs:** `docs/MEMBER_MODEL.md` (§ Naming vocabulary) · `docs/DOMAIN_CANONICALS.md` · `docs/SYSTEM_COHERENCE.md` §8.8

## Product truth (do not invert)

| User action | Mechanism | NOT this |
|-------------|-----------|----------|
| **Buddy Host** on map | `profileComplete` → `publish.canPublish` (`GET /me/status`) → `/welcome` if incomplete | `/become-host`, host application |
| **Pro / agency / shop** | `/profile/pro-membership`, `host_applications` | Bare “become host” funnel in consumer UI |
| **Join / participate** on an outing | `activity_requests`, `POST /activities/:id/requests` (signed-in only) | Profile completion, publish tier, or host onboarding |
| **Host reviews joiners** | `GET/PATCH /workspace/requests` (**activity** queue; SPA `/operator/requests`) | `registerHost*JoinRequest*` without **Activity** in the name |

**UI labels:** **Host** = individual on an outing; **Operator** = any publishing identity + desk (`/operator/*`) — not `/me/*` API names. **`UserRole` (TENANT_GUIDE, …) ≠ publish tier.** Gates: **`MemberStatusDTO`** / **`status.publish`** from `api.getMemberStatus()` / `useMemberStatus`.

## Code placement

| Concern | Location |
|---------|----------|
| Tier resolver | `apps/api/src/services/member-status.ts` (`resolveMemberStatus`) only |
| Publish enforcement | `member-publish-gate.ts` on create/publish |
| Client | `src/api/domains/member.ts` → `getMemberStatus` · `src/hooks/useMemberStatus.ts` |
| Pro path constant (FE) | `src/config/memberRoutes.ts` |
| Pro path constant (API meta) | `apps/api/src/lib/member-routes.ts` |

## Before finishing host/member changes

1. Run **`npm run verify:system:quick`** (includes host-member + domain/naming guards). Full pass: `npm run verify:system`.
2. New `/host/*` registrars: name must include **Activity**, **Team**, **Tenant**, or **Legacy** — never ambiguous `JoinRequest` alone.
3. Domain types: use **`TenantPublishingPurpose`**, not `string`, for `publishingPurpose`.
4. Grep: no new `path: '/become-host'` in `apps/api/src` (use `PRO_MEMBERSHIP_PATH`).
5. No new consumer links to `/become-host` (redirect route only); use `PRO_MEMBERSHIP_PATH` / `proMembershipPath()`.
6. No new `isHostRole(` for product gates in `src/` (console access → `canAccessOperatorWorkspace` from `useMemberStatus`).

